    ],
    [
      "P031",
      "4 Shipboard Installation and Tests\n4-8-4\niii)\nContainer carriers or dry cargo vessels carrying dangerous goods or vehicles with fuel in\ntheir tanks.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P032",
      "See 5C-5-7/3.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P033",
      "iv)\nRoll-on/roll-off vessels carrying vehicles with fuel in their tanks.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P034",
      "See 5C-10-4/3 and\n5C-10-4/5.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P035",
      "v)\nLiquefied gas carriers carrying flammable gases.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P036",
      "See 5C-8-1/2.24.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P037",
      "vi)\nChemical carriers carrying flammable liquid having a flash point of 60°C or below.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P038",
      "See\n5C-9-10/1.4.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P039",
      "vii)\nDrilling vessels performing exploratory or production drilling of hydrocarbon deposits.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P040",
      "See 4-3-6/3 of the ABS Mobile Offshore Unit Rules.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P041",
      "viii)\nFloating hydrocarbon production facilities.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P042",
      "See the ABS Rules for Building and Classing\nFloating Production Installations.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P043",
      "27.3.3 Miscellaneous Spaces",
      true,
      "heading",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      []
    ],
    [
      "P044",
      "The following spaces are to be regarded as hazardous areas:\n27.3.3(a) Paint stores.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P045",
      "Within the paint store; open deck area within 1 m (3 ft) from ventilation\ninlet and natural ventilation outlet; and open deck area within 3 m (10 ft) from power ventilation\noutlet.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P046",
      "Enclosed spaces giving access to the paint store may be considered as non-hazardous,\nprovided that:\ni)\nThe door to the paint store is gastight with self-closing devices without holding back\narrangements,\nii)\nThe paint store is provided with an acceptable, independent, natural ventilation system\nventilated from a safe area, and\niii)\nWarning notices are fitted adjacent to the paint store entrance stating that the store\ncontains flammable liquids.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P047",
      "27.3.3(b) Battery rooms.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P048",
      "Within the battery room; open deck area within 1m (3 ft) from natural\nventilation outlet, and open area within 3 m (10 ft) from power ventilation outlet.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P049",
      "See 4-8-4/5.3.1.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P050",
      "27.3.3(c) Helicopter refueling facilities.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P051",
      "Enclosed space containing components of the refueling\npump/equipment; and open deck area within 3 m (10 ft) from ventilation outlet of enclosed space\ncontaining refueling pump/equipment, 3 m (10 ft) from tank vent outlet, and 3 m (10 ft) from\nrefueling pump/equipment.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P052",
      "27.3.3(d) Acetylene storage room. (2020)\nWithin the storage room; open deck area within 1 m (3 ft) from natural ventilation outlet, and open\narea within 3 m (10 ft) from power ventilation outlet.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P053",
      "See 4-6-7/7.3.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P054",
      "The area within 3 m (10 ft) of\nthe gas cylinders pressure relief device discharge outlet.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P055",
      "See 4-6-7/7.5.4.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P056",
      "27.3.3(e) Heated Fuel Oil Storage Tank (2021)\nThe area within 3 m (10 ft) of the outlet of the vent pipes of Fuel Oil Tanks (e.g., fuel oil settling\nand service tanks) where the tanks are heated and the length of the vent pipes from the tank top to\nthe vent outlet is not sufficient for cooling the vapors to below 60°C.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P057",
      "See 4-6-4/13.5.7.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P058",
      "27.5 Certified Safe Equipment in Hazardous Areas",
      true,
      "heading",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P059",
      "27.5.1 General (2020)",
      true,
      "heading",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S007"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P060",
      "Only certified safe electrical equipment of the following types complying with IEC Publication",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S008"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P061",
      "60079 series, or other recognized standards, as described in 4-8-3/13 is to be considered for\ninstallation in hazardous areas.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S008"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P062",
      "● Intrinsically safe type (Ex i).",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S008"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P063",
      "IEC 60079-11\n● Flameproof type (explosion-proof) (Ex d).",
      true,
      "prose",
      "837:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S008"
      ]
    ],
    [
